1
00:00:00,821 --> 00:00:02,191
(Raj:)I think you're wonderful.

2
00:00:09,763 --> 00:00:11,353
(Lucy:)I'm sweating out of my head.

3
00:00:15,636 --> 00:00:20,406
(Howard:)The dragon falls
from the sky, crashing into the volcano.

4
00:00:22,309 --> 00:00:24,539
(Howard:)But wait, he's not dead.

5
00:00:24,711 --> 00:00:30,151
(Howard:)He crawls out, spreads his wings
and prepares to attack...

6
00:00:30,684 --> 00:00:31,984
(Leonard:)Wait.

7
00:00:33,453 --> 00:00:35,823
(Sheldon:)Doesn't he say something first?

8
00:00:35,989 --> 00:00:39,649
(Sheldon:)Maybe in the voice of a beloved celebrity?

9
00:00:40,727 --> 00:00:41,787
(Bernadette:)Fine.

10
00:00:41,962 --> 00:00:44,992
"You'd think, after all these years...

11
00:00:45,499 --> 00:00:49,329
(Howard:)...I'd know not to fly over volcanoes.

12
00:00:51,672 --> 00:00:53,042
I'm a frigging idiot."

13
00:00:55,709 --> 00:00:59,699
The dragon's Christopher Walken. Perfect.

